35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The road closures were bad, but delivery windows slip too.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,No one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it’s flat budget.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Two outer wards lost their bus link entirely.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, that twelve-month limit sounds risky for long-term plans.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, so we can’t rely on external staff without training?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. The skills aren’t on the roster.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, if they can’t get here, the service is useless.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, an hour’s round trip is too much for many.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The scanning contractors slip when big clients book first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The vehicle running line overran by a third last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The retired tradespeople run the repair clinic, but tools are uncertified.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The equipment allocation closed under budget, which is good.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Evening rooms are full, but remote use peaks after lock-up.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,We need a service that doesn’t depend on fragile supply chains.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And one that doesn’t repeat past failures.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,And one that fits our current staff skills.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,And one that survives the second year.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,And one that reaches people who can’t come to us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
