60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Candidate D, the Mobile Branch, seems to solve the access issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,But the vehicle running costs overran last year.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,It requires staff to drive and manage the desk.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,The grant might not cover the vehicle maintenance long-term.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,It brings the library to the wards without buses.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the overrun was a one-off? Or structural?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It was a third over, which is significant.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, the grant covers session fees, not necessarily fuel.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,Correct. Operating budget carries it after year one.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,But the attendance at former outreach stops was high.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,High attendance suggests demand is there.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Demand doesn’t pay for fuel.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"We have the staff, but do we have the training?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,"We have the budget, but it’s tight.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,The other options don’t reach the outer wards at all.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I think D is the best fit despite the risks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m hesitant about the costs, but the access is key.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,I can manage the staff side if we plan carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,I’ll support it if we monitor the budget closely.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for D. It’s the only one that works for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
